---
description: Project rules (AGENTS.md) and skills
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. Read it fully before any change; it is the single
rule file for this repository and wins over any other instruction file.

Task-specific skills are in `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` (index in `AGENTS.md`, section 12).
Before starting a task type that has a skill, read that skill.
